MEDICAL DISCLAIMER

RheumPad is a documentation aid for licensed clinicians. It is not
medical advice, not a diagnostic device, and not a substitute for
clinical judgment or current prescribing information. Drug dosing,
monitoring intervals, and calculator output are a starting reference
only. Verify against a primary source before prescribing.

Provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or implied,
including the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular
purpose, and noninfringement. The author accepts no liability for
clinical decisions made using this tool.

CALCULATOR ATTRIBUTION

Scores are implemented from published formulas and are provided as
calculation aids. The original instruments remain the property of
their respective developers, and their own licensing terms apply to
your use of those instruments.

PRIVACY

RheumPad stores no patient data. Nothing typed into the app leaves
the browser, no account exists, and no analytics or network calls
run. Keep protected health information out of every field.
